{"id":"f10e7dc46c9f05fb","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-solovay-equiv.md","title":"Martin-Löf 与 Solovay 检验等价","display":"thm-solovay-equiv — Martin-Löf 与 Solovay 检验等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-solovay-equiv","aliases":["43-thm-solovay-equiv"],"display":"thm-solovay-equiv — Martin-Löf 与 Solovay 检验等价","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-solovaytest]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.3.2 Theorem 9.3.8，印刷180，PDF200","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-solovay-equiv"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-solovay-equiv</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solovay-equiv — Martin-Löf 与 Solovay 检验等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f44d765a27163f8\" href=\"?note=4f44d765a27163f8\" title=\"43-df-solovaytest\">43-df-solovaytest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.3.2 Theorem 9.3.8，印刷180，PDF200"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SolovayTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{SolovayTest}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f44d765a27163f8\" href=\"?note=4f44d765a27163f8\" title=\"43-df-solovaytest\">43-df-solovaytest</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SolovayTest}(S)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge N\\Rightarrow X\\notin S_n)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SolovayTest}(S)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge N\\Rightarrow X\\notin S_n)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键是重复命中次数的Markov测度界；不要求Solovay测度和的有效收敛模。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.3.2 Theorem 9.3.8，印刷180，PDF200。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovaytest","status":"resolved","id":"4f44d765a27163f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovaytest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\mathrm{SolovayTest}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-solovaytest]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovaytest","status":"resolved","id":"4f44d765a27163f8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\mathrm{SolovayTest}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-solovaytest]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SolovayTest}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SolovayTest}(S)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge N\\Rightarrow X\\notin S_n)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1159,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-240","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-solovay-equiv]] — Martin-Löf 与 Solovay 检验等价"}],"outgoing":["0586e0fd0301d605","4f44d765a27163f8"]}